# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136, limit break 9 part 1): the Nomad Moogle in Ru'Lude Gardens (default 10045 (0, 2,
# 0, 0)). A level 86 Warrior with the Limit Breaker at level cap 90, the three earlier limit breaks completed (a GM,
# before login), MAX_LEVEL 99, 10 merit points. Available: a crest and a Faded Crystal (no trade handler while
# available: nothing); 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, Option 0, the item drawn: itemWanted 0, so math.randomInt(0, 9), the seeded
# RNG: 2, the Orcish Plate Armor, kept as itemWanted 3); updates 7 and 9 (nothing), 8 (Beat Around the Bushin not
# completed: updateEvent(0)); finish option 0 (nothing); the next 10045 draws nothing (itemWanted set); options 10 and 13
# (nothing), 12 (Option 1: the next 10045 shows it), then 11 (begun). Accepted, Prog 0: event 10045 (86, 1, 4, 1, 0, 3:
# itemWanted, the index + 1, a kept quirk), (86, 2, ...) once the Limit Breaker is gone (a GM); Prog 2 (a GM): the same
# reminder. The trade: the crest and the armor with 9 merit points (nil); with 10: the crest alone, the armor alone, two
# crests and the armor, the pair and a stone, the crest and a Magicked Skull (another item of the table) (nil each); the
# pair: 10191, finished with 12 merit points (a GM, 10191 open): the pair taken (confirmTrade), 12 - 10 = 2 merit points,
# Prog 1. Prog 1: progressEvent 10192 (86, 0, 0, 2), the timing game: the update answers 0 under 420 frames, 1 under 540,
# 2 under 660, 3 under 780, else 4 (each edge both sides); finish options 539 and 660 (nothing), 540 with a full bag (a
# key item reward: completed anyway): the Soul Gem, level cap 95, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_95. Completed: Prelude to
# Puissance answers at cap 95 (86, 1, 4, 2); at cap 90 again (a GM): the default; the pair: nothing.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventUpdate/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventUpdate/10192 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10191 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10192
